---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Influenza Symptoms — Complete Guide"
  description="Comprehensive guide to all influenza symptoms: early signs, common symptoms, severe symptoms, day-by-day timeline, and symptoms by age group."
>
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <header class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-teal-600 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Symptoms Hub</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-navy-900 mt-2 mb-4">
        Influenza Symptoms: The Complete Guide
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
        Everything you need to know about flu symptoms — from the first signs to full recovery.
        Evidence-based information organized for quick answers.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick answers -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-16">
      <a href="/symptoms/common-flu-symptoms/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 hover:border-teal-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
        <span class="text-2xl block mb-2">🤒</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Common Symptoms</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Fever, cough, body aches & more</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/symptoms/early-flu-symptoms/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 hover:border-teal-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
        <span class="text-2xl block mb-2">🔍</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Early Warning Signs</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">First symptoms to watch for</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/symptoms/severe-symptoms/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 hover:border-red-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
        <span class="text-2xl block mb-2">🚨</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-800 group-hover:text-red-600 transition-colors">Severe Symptoms</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">When to seek emergency care</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/symptoms/flu-symptoms-timeline/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 hover:border-teal-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
        <span class="text-2xl block mb-2">📅</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Day-by-Day Timeline</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Symptom progression guide</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Symptoms by group -->
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-800 mb-6">Symptoms by Age & Risk Group</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-16">
      <a href="/symptoms/flu-symptoms-in-children/" class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 hover:bg-teal-100/30 hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-2xl block mb-2">👶</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Flu in Children</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Symptoms and warning signs for kids ages 0-12</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/symptoms/flu-symptoms-in-babies/" class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 hover:bg-teal-100/30 hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-2xl block mb-2">🍼</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Flu in Babies & Infants</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Critical signs for children under 2</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/symptoms/flu-symptoms-in-elderly/" class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 hover:bg-teal-100/30 hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-2xl block mb-2">🧓</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Flu in the Elderly</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Why symptoms differ in older adults</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/symptoms/flu-during-pregnancy/" class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 hover:bg-teal-100/30 hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-2xl block mb-2">🤰</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Flu During Pregnancy</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Risks, symptoms, and safety guidance</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/symptoms/flu-in-immunocompromised/" class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 hover:bg-teal-100/30 hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-2xl block mb-2">🏥</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Immunocompromised</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Special considerations for weakened immunity</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Deep dive articles -->
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-800 mb-6">In-Depth Symptom Articles</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <a href="/symptoms/common-flu-symptoms/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Complete Guide to Common Flu Symptoms</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Fever, chills, cough, sore throat, body aches, fatigue, headache — what each symptom means and how to manage it.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Read guide →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/symptoms/flu-symptoms-timeline/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Flu Symptoms Day by Day: What to Expect</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">From incubation to recovery — the full timeline of influenza symptoms. Know what's normal at each stage.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Read timeline →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/symptoms/can-you-have-flu-without-fever/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Can You Have the Flu Without a Fever?</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Yes — especially in older adults and young children. Learn why and what other symptoms to watch for.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Read more →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/symptoms/flu-body-aches/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Flu Body Aches: Why They Happen & How to Relieve Them</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">The science behind flu-related muscle pain and practical relief strategies.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Read more →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
